{"unit_id": "tag:01N4:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为分次环（graded ring）。设<MATH_0002>。\n在开子概形（open subscheme）这一概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>（<REF_0001>）上，我们有三元组（triple）<MATH_0004>。显然，若<MATH_0005>，则三元组（triples）<MATH_0006>与<MATH_0007>限制（restricted）到开集（open）<MATH_0008>上时等价（equivalent）（这个开集是<MATH_0009>的子集（subset））。由此结合引理<REF_0002>可知，态射（morphisms）<MATH_0010>大致对应于<MATH_0011>上三元组（triples）的等价类（equivalence classes）。这种说法并不完全准确，因为若<MATH_0012>不是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，就可能没有一个三元组（triple）能满足要求。因此，定义相应的函子（functor）时需要稍加小心。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n下面是一种可能的做法。设<MATH_0013>。\n考虑函子（functors）之间的变换（transformation）<MATH_0014>，它将三元组（triple）<MATH_0015>（在<MATH_0016>上）送到三元组（triple）<MATH_0017>。引理<REF_0003>的结论之一是，变换（transformation）<MATH_0018>是单射（injective）的！\n对于拟紧（quasi-compact）概形（scheme）<MATH_0019>，我们定义\n<MATH_0020>\n其中的过渡映射（transition maps）如上所述。这显然定义了一个反变函子（contravariant functor）。它定义在一个范畴（category）上，该范畴由拟紧（quasi-compact）概形（schemes）构成。它取值于集合（sets）。对于一般的概形（scheme）<MATH_0021>，我们定义\n<MATHSEG_0001> 拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）<MATHSEG_0002>\n换言之，元素（element）<MATH_0022>属于<MATH_0023>，它对应于一个相容系（compatible system），该系由对元素（elements）<MATH_0024>的选择组成，其中<MATH_0025>遍历<MATH_0026>的所有拟紧（quasi-compact）开集（opens）。\n我们略去拉回（pullback）映射（map）<MATH_0027>的定义，它对应于态射（morphism）<MATH_0028>，后者在概形（schemes）之间。\n这样，我们就定义了所需的函子（functor）\n<MATH_0029>\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "triples", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "restricted", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "triples", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "equivalence classes", "target_term": "等价类"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "transition maps", "target_term": "过渡映射"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "compatible system", "target_term": "相容系"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "环带有分次结构。"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "承载三元组的开子概形。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "原文在开子概形之后再次使用概形一词。"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "开子概形上的三元组。"}, {"source_term": "triples", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "限制到同一个开集上的两个三元组。"}, {"source_term": "restricted", "target_term": "限制", "context": "把三元组限制到开集上。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "用来限制三元组的开集。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "两个限制后的三元组之间的关系。"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集", "context": "限制所用的开集与另一集合之间的包含关系。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "与等价类大致对应的态射。"}, {"source_term": "triples", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "构成等价类的三元组。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence classes", "target_term": "等价类", "context": "按照三元组之间的等价关系得到的类。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "适用单个三元组时涉及的拟紧性。"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "单个可能满足要求的三元组。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "需要定义的函子。"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "变换所联系的两个函子。"}, {"source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换", "context": "函子之间的变换。"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "函子之间的变换所接受的三元组。"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "函子之间的变换所给出的三元组。"}, {"source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换", "context": "引理断言为单射的变换。"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "描述所述变换的单射性。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "限定此处用于定义的概形。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处用来定义函子的拟紧概形。"}, {"source_term": "transition maps", "target_term": "过渡映射", "context": "定义中所用的过渡映射。"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子", "context": "定义所得的函子具有反变性。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "该函子定义在由拟紧概形构成的范畴上。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "限定反变函子所定义于的范畴中的概形。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "构成该范畴的概形。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "反变函子的取值为集合。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "一般情形中用来定义函子的概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集", "context": "数学文字中对开集所作的拟紧性限定。"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "与一个相容系对应的元素。"}, {"source_term": "compatible system", "target_term": "相容系", "context": "由对各元素的相容选择构成的系。"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "相容系所选取的元素。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "限定所遍历的开集。"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集", "context": "由指标遍历的开集。"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "由概形态射诱导的拉回。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "所略去定义的拉回映射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "与所述拉回映射对应的态射。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所述态射的两端都是概形。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "这段定义所得到的函子。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01NC:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为分次环（graded ring）。设<MATH_0002>。\n上面定义的函子（functor）<MATH_0003>是可表（representable）的，表出它的是概形（scheme）<MATH_0004>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "引理设定的环具有分次结构。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "上文定义的函子。"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表", "context": "说明函子可由所给概形表出。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "表出所述函子的对象是概形。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01NC:proof", "translation": "上面已经看到，函子（functor）<MATH_0001>对应于开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0002>。此外，上面定义的函子（functors）之间的变换（transformation）<MATH_0003>（若<MATH_0004>）对应于包含态射（inclusion morphism）<MATH_0005>（见上面的讨论）。因此，要证明<MATH_0006>由<MATH_0007>表出（represented），只需证明对于<MATH_0008>，当所取的是拟紧（quasi-compact）概形（scheme）<MATH_0009>时，它落在某个<MATH_0010>中，并且对于一般的概形（scheme）<MATH_0011>，有\n<MATHSEG_0001> 拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）<MATHSEG_0002>\n这些验证从略。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换"}, {"source_term": "inclusion morphism", "target_term": "包含态射"}, {"source_term": "represented", "target_term": "表出"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "与开子概形对应的函子。"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "与上述函子对应的开子概形。"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "上文定义的变换所联系的函子。"}, {"source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换", "context": "上文定义的函子之间的变换。"}, {"source_term": "inclusion morphism", "target_term": "包含态射", "context": "与函子之间的变换对应的概形包含态射。"}, {"source_term": "represented", "target_term": "表出", "context": "由指定对象表出函子。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "限定第一项待验证结论所针对的概形。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一项待验证结论中的拟紧概形。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二项待验证结论中的一般概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集", "context": "数学文字中出现的拟紧开集条件。"}], "notes": []}
